  <JobName.engineer_arcane>电荷工程师</JobName.engineer_arcane>
  <JobDescription.engineer_arcane>把符咒当电路图，把反应堆当魔导炉。保留工程师天赋树，并拥有额外的电荷分支。</JobDescription.engineer_arcane>
  <JobName.engineer_mystic>放射工程师</JobName.engineer_mystic>
  <JobDescription.engineer_mystic>反应堆里住着东西，而你和它签了合同。保留工程师天赋树，并拥有额外的放射分支。</JobDescription.engineer_mystic>
